title = "A letter for Rome"
old_title = "A letter for Rome"
level = 5
summary = "THE BARONS SEND ENVOYS TO ROME TO ASK FORGIVENESS. ASSEMBLE THEIR ACCOUNT FROM THE WORDS ON THE WRITING TABLE: THE VERSION ZAMPANO READS ALOUD CAN PLEAD NECESSITY OR NAME THE DEBT OUTRIGHT. WHEN THE ENVOYS COME BACK, THE MARSHAL'S VERSION OF THE ANSWER AND THE CAMP'S VERSION ARE NOT THE SAME."
